OL,3,GNEWSADecision delayed on data centre
OL,4,Anear travellers site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision on plans to build a #2.5bn
OL,7,Fdata centre next to a travellers site
OL,8,Fhas been delayed.
OL,10,FA travellers group said the project in
OL,11,FWatford could cause indirect
OL,12,Fdiscrimination through "loss of
OL,13,Famenity, sleep disturbance and
OL,14,Fenvironmental stress".
OL,16,FThe developer, Ark Data Centres, said
OL,17,Fit had engaged with the local community
OL,18,Fthroughout the planning process and
OL,19,Fwould continue to do so throughout the
OL,20,Fconstruction process.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
