OL,3,GNEWSADecision delayed on data centre
OL,4,Anear travellers site
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Hertsmere councillors voted on
OL,7,FThursday to defer a decision because
OL,8,Fthey were worried about the visual
OL,9,Fimpact, demands on the water supply and
OL,10,Fa lack of financial contributions.
